# Physgloves: the target highlight in a dim room (tube physgloves, run alone with --fixtures=physgloves-dim --frames=22):
# the box on the high shelf under one weak lamp, as the player sees it targeted before the pull.
world room
camera 5.4 8.5 -999 0 0
light 6.4 6.6 3.0 .55 6
scene pull
size 1600 900
frames 110
